.TH TWEEN_DONE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
tween_done \- True once the tween has finished (or never started)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.BI "bool tween_done(const Tween *tw);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True once the tween has finished (or never started). Chain tweens by starting the next one when this returns true.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
!tw\->active.
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tween_start (3),
.BR tween_update (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
